 way out can read is worked out there (armgba_lazy_carry), and a return into a
 block's middle earns its block a careful copy to carry on in
 (armgba_mid_careful 2; at 3 a place returned to again and again gets a block
 of its own; armGBA 2.0, 5230ef8, already carries on in a copy that is there)


